1. **Chapter I, Article 1.1 (Biophysical Reality Primacy)**: Reaffirmed. Physical flow minimums are hard-coded into mechanical infrastructure rather than relying on delayed diplomatic arbitration.
2. **Chapter I, Article 1.2 (Usufructuary Commons & Anti-Monopoly)**: Reaffirmed. Upstream basins cannot claim allodial sovereignty over fluid commons traversing their geographic boundaries.
3. **Chapter I, Article 1.3 (Unconditional Metabolic Baseline Survival)**: Preserved intact. No human being is starved, dehydrated, or denied clinical care for free-riding or labor default; Tier 1 survival remains absolute and non-contingent.
4. **Chapter I, Article 1.5 (Prohibition of Carceral & Coercive Restraint)**: Preserved. Defectors are neither imprisoned nor subjected to bodily violence. Sanctions are strictly confined to the automated escrow of societal energetic surplus (Tier 2/3 Usufruct) and persistent civic summons.